,status_detail:"Answered \u2014 nothing to ship",is_noteworthy:!1,title:"useQuery focus re-fetch explainer",recent_action:"Explained the focus-refetch default and how to disable it.",needs_action:"",description:"React Query's `refetchOnWindowFocus` defaults to true because focus is a cheap freshness signal in case another tab mutated state. Disable it per-query with `{ refetchOnWindowFocus: false }` rather than globally, since the global switch tends to mask freshness bugs elsewhere. For your projects query, set it per-query with a comment explaining why."}),origin:"claude_in_slack",updated_at:FIe(22)}),BIe({id:"mock-coordinator",title:"Coordinator",session_status:"idle",tags:["_coordinator"],post_turn_summary:UIe({status_category:"idle",status_detail:"Idle, awaiting next instruction",is_noteworthy:!1,title:"Coordinator",recent_action:"Finished dispatching the previous batch of sessions.",needs_action:"",description:"Coordinates child sessions. Currently idle."}),updated_at:FIe(2)}),BIe({id:"mock-multi-1",title:"Bump agent-sdk across apps + monorepo",session_status:"idle",session_context:qIe([{repo:"anthropics/apps",branch:"claude/bump-sdk-apps"},{repo:"anthropics/anthropic",branch:"claude/bump-sdk-monorepo"}]),post_turn_summary:UIe({status_category:"review_ready",status_detail:"Both PRs open, CI in progress",is_noteworthy:!0,title:"agent-sdk 0.14.2 cross-repo bump",recent_action:"Pinned `@anthropic-ai/agent-sdk` to `0.14.2` in both repos and opened PRs \u2014 CI is running on each.",needs_action:"Review [apps PR #31547](https://github.com/anthropics/apps/pull/31547) and [monorepo PR #331378](https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic/pull/331378) \u2014 merge monorepo first",description:"**Result**\nThe SDK is at 0.14.2 in both repos via [apps PR #31547](https://github.com/anthropics/apps/pull/31547) and [monorepo PR #331378](https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic/pull/331378); the merge order is in the [migration doc](https://docs.google.com/document/d/mock-migratio